node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.tmp-pnpm7-store/
*.log
.DS_Store
# M19: docs/* (not docs/) so the negation below can still re-include one
# tracked file -- a trailing-slash directory ignore prevents git from ever
# evaluating per-file negations inside it.
# M21-WU05/WU09: extended with the coverage baseline and maintainer
# recovery runbook -- each new tracked docs/ file must be added here
# explicitly, per docs/versioning.md's relevant-paths discipline.
# Lean Governance v0.2: extended with the docs/engineering/ directory,
# which holds the shared milestone-protocol/owner-map/prompt-template
# governance documents referenced by future milestone specs.
docs/*
!docs/versioning.md
!docs/coverage-baseline.md
!docs/maintainer-recovery.md
!docs/engineering/
